WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.450
Now the program's code.

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:06.139
There's one Logic App definition, and
every integration deploys the same one;

3
00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.158
what changes is data, four parameters:
the Graph host for the cloud,

4
00:00:10.158 --> 00:00:14.475
the downstream system and its audience,
and which workflows it serves.

5
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:16.413
Each run goes in four steps.

6
00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:20.212
First it checks the request, and
if the callback path isn't the

7
00:00:20.212 --> 00:00:24.163
resume path for this very task, it
stops and sends nothing at all.

8
00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:28.841
Then it looks up the operation, calls the
downstream system with bounded retries,

9
00:00:28.841 --> 00:00:33.170
and always calls back, telling the
truth about whether the work succeeded.
